{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10360","headline":"淇上别刘少府子英 · 高适","name":"淇上别刘少府子英","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近来住淇上，萧条惟空林。\n又非耕种时，闲散多自任。\n伊君独知我，驱马欲招寻。\n千里忽携手，十年同苦心。\n求仁见交态，於道喜甘临。\n逸思乃天纵，微才应陆沈。\n飘然归故乡，不复问离襟。\n南登黎阳渡，莽苍寒云阴。\n桑叶原上起，河淩山下深。\n途穷更远别，相对益悲吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}